<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">26 December in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">4 events that happened on 26 December, from 1776 to 2004.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-event-hero"><p class="tih-hero-kicker">&#10022; Anniversary of the day</p><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1776 CE <span class="tih-ago">250 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Washington defeats the Hessians at Trenton</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Washington's army surprised the Hessian garrison at Trenton, capturing about 900 soldiers with few American losses. The victory revived the Revolution after months of defeat.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1825 CE <span class="tih-ago">201 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">The Decembrist revolt fails in St Petersburg</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Army officers led troops onto Senate Square to refuse allegiance to Nicholas I and demand reform. Cannon fire dispersed them; five leaders were hanged, and the Decembrists inspired later Russian radicals.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1898 CE <span class="tih-ago">128 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">The Curies announce the discovery of radium</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">A paper presented to the French Academy of Sciences announced radium, a new element found in pitchblende by Marie and Pierre Curie with Gustave Bémont. It later proved vital in early cancer treatment.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">2004 CE <span class="tih-ago">22 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">An earthquake and tsunami devastate the Indian Ocean</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">A magnitude 9.1 earthquake off Sumatra sent tsunamis across the Indian Ocean, killing about 230,000 people in 14 countries. Indonesia, Sri Lanka, India and Thailand were worst hit.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sri-lanka">Sri Lanka</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/indonesia">Indonesia</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thailand">Thailand</a></div></div></li></ol>
